# Kconfig for Xiaomi USB-C Dock / Daughter Board
#

config XIAOMI_USB_DOCK
	tristate "Xiaomi USB-C Dock / Daughter Board support"
	depends on USB && USB_ROLE_SWITCH
	depends on TYPEC
	depends on TYPEC_DP_ALTMODE || !TYPEC_DP_ALTMODE
	depends on EXTCON
	depends on REGULATOR
	select USB_COMMON
	help
	  Enable support for the Xiaomi USB-C dock daughter board.

	  The dock connects to a Xiaomi smartphone or tablet via a single
	  USB Type-C cable and provides:
	    - USB 3.1 Gen 2 host hub (up to 4x USB-A + 1x USB-C)
	    - DisplayPort 1.4 Alt Mode (4K@60 Hz)
	    - HDMI 2.0 output (via on-dock DP bridge)
	    - Gigabit Ethernet (USB3-to-GbE)
	    - USB Power Delivery pass-through charging (up to 65 W)
	    - UHS-I SD / microSD card reader
	    - 3.5 mm analog audio jack

	  Compatible Xiaomi devices:
	    Xiaomi 14 Ultra, Xiaomi 15 Ultra, Xiaomi Pad 6 Pro,
	    Xiaomi Pad 6S Pro 12.4, Xiaomi Pad 7 Pro, MIX Fold 4

	  If unsure, say N.
